# Harbor frontend configuration.
# Copy to .env.local to override the defaults (public Soroban testnet).
# All values can also be overridden at runtime from the Settings page.
#
# Environment Variables Reference Table:
# | Variable Name                          | Purpose                                      | Default                                       | Example                                                  |
# | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
# | NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_CONTRACT_ID         | Deployed C-address of the contract          | CD4U2T3X5K7G2J6L4A8B9Z1Y0W_MOCK_CONTRACT_ID  | CDQMLR7BUWEGNRVVMVYQYBTANAG3JXLDRR4V4RZYPOOG53XDKGC3PJYQ  |
# | NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_RPC_URL             | Soroban RPC endpoint                        | https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org           | https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org                      |
# | NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_NETWORK_PASSPHRASE  | Stellar Network Passphrase                   | Test SDF Network ; September 2015             | Public Global Stellar Network ; October 2015             |
# | NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_TOKEN_DECIMALS      | Base token decimal places (USDC = 6)         | 6                                             | 6                                                        |
# | NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_EVENTS_URL          | HTTP URL of the listener payout indexer API  | (unset)                                       | http://localhost:8787/payouts                            |

# Deployed C-address of the hedegpay_batch contract.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_CONTRACT_ID=CD4U2T3X5K7G2J6L4A8B9Z1Y0W_MOCK_CONTRACT_ID

# Soroban RPC endpoint.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org

# Network passphrase (Test SDF Network ; September 2015 | Public Global Stellar Network).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_NETWORK_PASSPHRASE="Test SDF Network ; September 2015"

# Decimal places of the base settlement token (USDC = 6).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_TOKEN_DECIMALS=6

# HTTP API exposed by the payout listener (Harbor-hq/harbor listener/index.js).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_HARBOR_EVENTS_URL=http://localhost:8787/payouts
